flowchart TD
  A[Run baseline, raw, partial-scale, and z-score variants] --> B[Inspect a fixed stress-evaluation row]
  B --> C{Raw wrong, z-score correct?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Preprocessing-fixable failure]
  C -->|No| E{Z-score still wrong?}
